			'3 now points to 7 and 7 already pointed to 9: the list is sorted. Without the previous line, which links the rest, 9 would have been lost.',
		),
		before: o5,
		after: o6,
	},
	{
		program: 'del',
		line: at('del', `${prev}->${nx} = ${cur}->${nx};`),
		prompt: t('Después de esta línea, ¿qué pasa con el nodo 7?', 'After this line, what happens to node 7?'),
		options: [
			t('Sigue enlazado en la lista', 'It is still linked in the list'),
			t('Sale de la lista, pero sigue reservado: falta liberarlo', 'It leaves the list but is still allocated: it still has to be freed'),
			t('Ya está liberado', 'It is already freed'),
		],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'Saltarlo solo cambia un puntero. El bloque sigue reservado y actual es su único dueño: si la función terminara aquí, sería una fuga. Falta free(actual).',
			'Skipping it only changes one pointer. The block is still allocated and current is its only owner: if the function ended here, it would be a leak. free(current) is still missing.',
		),
		before: d3,
		after: d4,
	},
	{
		program: 'delHead',
		line: at('delHead', `*${h} = ${cur}->${nx};`),
		prompt: t('Con eliminar(&cabeza, 3), después de esta línea, ¿a qué apunta cabeza?', 'With delete_value(&head, 3), after this line, what does head point to?'),
		options: [t('A NULL', 'To NULL'), t('Al nodo 7 (0x5080)', 'To node 7 (0x5080)'), t('Al nodo 3 (0x5010)', 'To node 3 (0x5010)')],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'anterior vale NULL, así que el nodo a eliminar es la cabeza. Hay que cambiar *cabeza para que apunte al segundo nodo; después se libera el 3.',
			'previous is NULL, so the node to delete is the head. *head has to change to point to the second node; then 3 is freed.',
		),
		before: dh1,
		after: dh2,
	},
	{
		program: 'destroy',
		line: at('destroy', `free(${cur});`),
		prompt: t('Después de free(actual), ¿en qué estado queda la cabeza de main?', 'After free(current), what state is main’s head in?'),
		options: [
			t('Válida: free la actualiza', 'Valid: free updates it'),
			t('Colgante: guarda 0x5010, un bloque que ya no existe', 'Dangling: it holds 0x5010, a block that no longer exists'),
			t('Vale NULL', 'It is NULL'),
		],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'free nunca cambia ningún puntero. Por eso destruir_lista termina con *cabeza = NULL: deja la lista vacía y válida.',
			'free never changes any pointer. That is why destroy_list ends with *head = NULL: it leaves the list empty and valid.',
		),
		before: y3,
		after: y4,
	},
];

/* ---------- Assess: no hints, graded at the end ---------- */

type AssessItem = { prompt: string; snippet: string; options: string[]; correct: number; reason: string };

const assess: AssessItem[] = [
	{
		prompt: t('¿Qué hace esta versión de insertar_al_inicio?', 'What does this version of insert_front do?'),
		snippet: programs.asFront,
		options: [
			t('Funciona igual que la correcta', 'It works the same as the correct one'),
			t('El nodo nuevo apunta a sí mismo y se pierde el resto de la lista', 'The new node points to itself and the rest of the list is lost'),
			t('No compila', 'It does not compile'),
			t('Solo falla con la lista vacía', 'It only fails with an empty list'),
		],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'Al asignar primero *cabeza = nuevo, la línea siguiente lee la cabeza ya cambiada: nuevo->siguiente = nuevo. El antiguo primer nodo y todo lo que sigue quedan inalcanzables: una fuga.',
			'Assigning *head = new_node first makes the next line read the already changed head: new_node->next = new_node. The old first node and everything after it become unreachable: a leak.',
		),
	},
	{
		prompt: t('¿Qué error de memoria tiene eliminar?', 'Which memory error does delete_value have?'),
		snippet: programs.asLeak,
		options: [t('Fuga de memoria', 'Memory leak'), t('Uso después de liberar', 'Use after free'), t('Doble liberación', 'Double free'), t('Ninguno: es correcta', 'None: it is correct')],
		correct: 0,
		reason: t(
			'El nodo queda fuera de la lista, pero nadie lo libera: falta free(actual). Una lista que es dueña de sus nodos tiene que liberar el que elimina.',
			'The node leaves the list, but nobody frees it: free(current) is missing. A list that owns its nodes must free the one it deletes.',
		),
	},
	{
		prompt: t('¿Qué informa AddressSanitizer al ejecutar destruir?', 'What does AddressSanitizer report when destroy runs?'),
		snippet: programs.asUaf,
		options: [
			'heap-use-after-free',
			t('LeakSanitizer: detected memory leaks', 'LeakSanitizer: detected memory leaks'),
			t('attempting double-free', 'attempting double-free'),
			t('Nada: es correcta', 'Nothing: it is correct'),
		],
		correct: 0,
		reason: t(
			'La expresión de avance del for, actual = actual->siguiente, se ejecuta después de free(actual): lee un campo de un nodo ya liberado. Hay que guardar el siguiente antes de liberar.',
			'The for loop’s advance expression, current = current->next, runs after free(current): it reads a field of an already freed node. The next node must be saved before freeing.',
		),
	},
	{
		prompt: t('La lista es 2 -> 8 -> 9. ¿Dónde queda el 5 después de insertar_ordenado(&cabeza, 5)?', 'The list is 2 -> 8 -> 9. Where does 5 end up after insert_sorted(&head, 5)?'),
		snippet: programs.asSorted,
		options: [t('Al inicio', 'At the start'), t('Entre el 2 y el 8', 'Between 2 and 8'), t('Entre el 8 y el 9', 'Between 8 and 9'), t('Al final', 'At the end')],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'5 no es menor o igual que 2, así que no va primero. El while avanza mientras el siguiente sea menor que 5: el 8 no lo es, y anterior se detiene en el 2. El 5 se cuelga después del 2.',
			'5 is not less than or equal to 2, so it does not go first. The while advances while the next node is smaller than 5: 8 is not, so previous stops at 2. 5 is hung after 2.',
		),
	},
	{
		prompt: t('¿Qué imprime este programa?', 'What does this program print?'),
		snippet: programs.asOutput,
		options: ['1 -> 2 -> 3 -> NULL', '3 -> 1 -> 2 -> NULL', '3 -> 2 -> 1 -> NULL', '2 -> 1 -> 3 -> NULL'],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'Inserta 1 al inicio (1), 2 al final (1 -> 2) y 3 al inicio (3 -> 1 -> 2). La lista se imprime desde la cabeza.',
			'It inserts 1 at the head (1), 2 at the tail (1 -> 2) and 3 at the head (3 -> 1 -> 2). The list is printed from the head.',
		),
	},
	{
		prompt: t('Con la lista 3 -> 7 -> 9, ¿qué pasa al llamar eliminar(&cabeza, 3)?', 'With the list 3 -> 7 -> 9, what happens when delete_value(&head, 3) is called?'),
		snippet: programs.asNoHead,
		options: [
			t('Elimina el 3 correctamente', 'It deletes 3 correctly'),
			t('Escribe a través de un puntero NULL: anterior vale NULL', 'It writes through a NULL pointer: previous is NULL'),
			t('Elimina el 7 por error', 'It deletes 7 by mistake'),
			t('Fuga: el 3 no se libera', 'Leak: 3 is not freed'),
		],
		correct: 1,
		reason: t(
			'El 3 es la cabeza, así que anterior sigue en NULL y anterior->siguiente desreferencia NULL. Falta el caso de la cabeza: if (anterior == NULL) *cabeza = actual->siguiente.',
			'3 is the head, so previous is still NULL and previous->next dereferences NULL. The head case is missing: if (previous == NULL) *head = current->next.',
		),
	},
];

const labels = {
	kind: {
		owner: t('dueño', 'owner'),
		borrow: t('préstamo', 'borrow'),
		dangling: t('colgante', 'dangling'),
		null: 'NULL',
		value: '',
	},
	status: {
		live: t('vivo', 'live'),
		freed: t('liberado', 'freed'),
		leaked: t('fuga: sin dueño', 'leak: no owner'),
		static: t('estático: no vino de malloc', 'static: not from malloc'),
	},
	ownerPrefix: t('Dueño: ', 'Owner: '),
	stepOf: t('Paso {n} de {m}', 'Step {n} of {m}'),
	correct: t('Correcto. ', 'Correct. '),
	wrong: t('No es así. ', 'Not quite. '),
	showAfter: t('Ver transición', 'Show transition'),
	showBefore: t('Volver al estado anterior', 'Back to the previous state'),
	score: t('Respondiste bien {n} de {m}.', 'You got {n} of {m} right.'),
	yourAnswer: t('Tu respuesta: ', 'Your answer: '),
	noAnswer: t('sin responder', 'no answer'),
	rightAnswer: t('Respuesta correcta: ', 'Correct answer: '),
	answered: t('Respondidas: {n} de {m}', 'Answered: {n} of {m}'),
	modes: { learn: t('Aprender', 'Learn'), practice: t('Practicar', 'Practice'), assess: t('Evaluar', 'Assess') },
};

const data = {
	learn: learn.map((s) => ({ steps: s.steps })),
	practice: practice.map((p) => ({ before: p.before, after: p.after, correct: p.correct, reason: p.reason, options: p.options })),
	assess: assess.map((a) => ({ correct: a.correct, reason: a.reason, options: a.options, prompt: a.prompt })),
	labels,
};
const dataJson = JSON.stringify(data).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');

const lines = (src: string) => src.split('\n');
const modes = [
	{ id: 'learn', label: labels.modes.learn },
	{ id: 'practice', label: labels.modes.practice },
	{ id: 'assess', label: labels.modes.assess },
];
---

<div class="le-screen" data-presentation="estructuras-enlazadas-c" data-lang={lang}>
	<div class="le-shell">
		<nav class="le-nav" aria-label={t('Controles de navegación', 'Navigation controls')}>
			<div class="le-seg" role="radiogroup" aria-label={t('Modo de la presentación', 'Presentation mode')}>
				{
					modes.map((m, i) => (
						<label class="le-seg-opt">
							<input type="radio" name="leMode" value={m.id} checked={i === 0} />
							<span>{m.label}</span>
						</label>
					))
				}
			</div>
			<div class="le-nav-group">
				<button class="le-btn" id="lePrevBtn" aria-label={t('Diapositiva anterior', 'Previous slide')} disabled>
					<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path>
					</svg>
					<span>{t('Anterior', 'Previous')}</span>
				</button>
				<span class="le-counter" id="leCounter" aria-live="polite">{labels.modes.learn} · 1 / {learn.length}</span>
				<button class="le-btn" id="leNextBtn" aria-label={t('Siguiente diapositiva', 'Next slide')}>
					<span>{t('Siguiente', 'Next')}</span>
					<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
					</svg>
				</button>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main class="le-viewport">
			<!-- Aprender / Learn -->
			<div class="le-mode" data-mode="learn">
				{
					learn.map((s, i) => (
						<section class:list={['le-slide', { 'is-active': i === 0 }]} data-slide={i + 1} data-kind="learn" data-index={i}>
							<div class="le-head">
								<span class="le-kicker">{t('Aprender', 'Learn')} · {s.kicker}</span>
								<h2 class="le-title">{s.title}</h2>
								<p class="le-lead">{s.lead}</p>
							</div>
							<div class="le-grid">
								<pre class="le-code" aria-label={t('Código del programa', 'Program code')}><code>{lines(programs[s.program]).map((l, n) => <span class="le-line" data-line={n + 1}><span class="le-ln" aria-hidden="true">{n + 1}</span>{l || ' '}</span>)}</code></pre>
								<div class="le-mem" data-mem>
									<div class="le-col">
										<span class="le-col-label">{t('Pila (variables)', 'Stack (variables)')}</span>
										<div data-stack></div>
									</div>
									<div class="le-col">
										<span class="le-col-label">{t('Bloques (heap)', 'Blocks (heap)')}</span>
										<div data-heap></div>
									</div>
									<svg class="le-arrows" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="le-alert" data-alert hidden></div>
							<div class="le-steps">
								<button class="le-btn" data-act="prev" aria-label={t('Paso anterior', 'Previous step')}>
									<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path>
									</svg>
								</button>
								<span class="le-step-label" data-step-label></span>
								<button class="le-btn le-btn-primary" data-act="next" aria-label={t('Siguiente paso', 'Next step')}>
									<span>{t('Siguiente paso', 'Next step')}</span>
									<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
									</svg>
								</button>
								<button class="le-btn" data-act="reset" aria-label={t('Reiniciar los pasos', 'Restart the steps')}>
									<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path>
										<path d="M3 3v5h5"></path>
									</svg>
								</button>
							</div>
							<p class="le-explain" data-explain aria-live="polite"></p>
						</section>
					))
				}
				<p class="le-note">{t('Las direcciones (0x5010, 0x5080…) son ilustrativas: cambian en cada ejecución.', 'Addresses (0x5010, 0x5080…) are illustrative: they change on every run.')}</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Practicar / Practice -->
			<div class="le-mode" data-mode="practice" hidden>
				{
					practice.map((p, i) => (
						<section class:list={['le-slide', { 'is-active': i === 0 }]} data-slide={i + 1} data-kind="practice" data-index={i}>
							<div class="le-head">
								<span class="le-kicker">{t('Practicar', 'Practice')} · {t('Predice el siguiente estado', 'Predict the next state')}</span>
								<h2 class="le-title">{p.prompt}</h2>
							</div>
							<div class="le-grid">
								<pre class="le-code" aria-label={t('Código del programa', 'Program code')}><code>{lines(programs[p.program]).map((l, n) => <span class:list={['le-line', { 'is-current': n + 1 === p.line }]} data-line={n + 1}><span class="le-ln" aria-hidden="true">{n + 1}</span>{l || ' '}</span>)}</code></pre>
								<div class="le-mem" data-mem>
									<div class="le-col">
										<span class="le-col-label">{t('Pila (variables)', 'Stack (variables)')}</span>
										<div data-stack></div>
									</div>
									<div class="le-col">
										<span class="le-col-label">{t('Bloques (heap)', 'Blocks (heap)')}</span>
										<div data-heap></div>
									</div>
									<svg class="le-arrows" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="le-options" role="group" aria-label={t('Opciones', 'Options')}>
								{p.options.map((o, k) => (
									<button class="le-opt" data-opt={k}>{o}</button>
								))}
							</div>
							<p class="le-feedback" data-feedback aria-live="polite"></p>
							<button class="le-btn" data-act="transition" disabled>{labels.showAfter}</button>
						</section>
					))
				}
			</div>

			<!-- Evaluar / Assess -->
			<div class="le-mode" data-mode="assess" hidden>
				{
					assess.map((a, i) => (
						<section class:list={['le-slide', { 'is-active': i === 0 }]} data-slide={i + 1} data-kind="assess" data-index={i}>
							<div class="le-head">
								<span class="le-kicker">{t('Evaluar', 'Assess')} · {t('Pregunta', 'Question')} {i + 1} / {assess.length}</span>
								<h2 class="le-title">{a.prompt}</h2>
							</div>
							<pre class="le-code le-code-static"><code>{lines(a.snippet).map((l, n) => <span class="le-line"><span class="le-ln" aria-hidden="true">{n + 1}</span>{l || ' '}</span>)}</code></pre>
							<div class="le-options" role="group" aria-label={t('Opciones', 'Options')}>
								{a.options.map((o, k) => (
									<button class="le-opt" data-pick={k} aria-pressed="false">{o}</button>
								))}
							</div>
						</section>
					))
				}
				<section class="le-slide" data-slide={assess.length + 1} data-kind="result">
					<div class="le-head">
						<span class="le-kicker">{t('Evaluar', 'Assess')} · {t('Resultado', 'Result')}</span>
						<h2 class="le-title">{t('Califica tus respuestas', 'Grade your answers')}</h2>
						<p class="le-lead" data-answered></p>
					</div>
					<div class="le-steps">
						<button class="le-btn le-btn-primary" data-act="grade">{t('Calificar', 'Grade')}</button>
						<button class="le-btn" data-act="retry">{t('Reiniciar la evaluación', 'Restart the assessment')}</button>
					</div>
					<div aria-live="polite">
						<p class="le-score" data-score></p>
						<ol class="le-results" data-results></ol>
					</div>
				</section>
			</div>
		</main>
	</div>
</div>

<script is:inline type="application/json" id="leData" set:html={dataJson}></script>

<style>
	.le-shell {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.le-screen {
		min-height: calc(100dvh - var(--site-header-height, 0px));
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		background: var(--color-bg);
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.le-viewport { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }

	.le-viewport {
		flex: 1;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1440px) { .le-viewport { zoom: 1.08; } }
	@media (min-width: 1680px) { .le-viewport { zoom: 1.16; } }
	@media (min-width: 1920px) { .le-viewport { zoom: 1.25; } }

	.le-nav {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
		background: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.le-nav-group {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-3);
	}

	/* Segmented control ported from Organic/styles.css (.seg / .seg-opt). */
	.le-seg {
		display: inline-flex;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-bg);
	}

	.le-seg-opt {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-1);
		padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.le-seg-opt input {
		position: absolute;
		opacity: 0;
		width: 0;
		height: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.le-seg-opt + .le-seg-opt { border-left: 1px solid var(--color-divider); }
	.le-seg-opt:has(input:checked) { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg); }
	.le-seg-opt:not(:has(input:checked)):hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 7%, transparent); }
	.le-seg-opt:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: -2px; }

	.le-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-text);
		background: var(--color-bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		border-radius: 999px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.le-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-accent-700);
	}

	.le-btn:focus-visible,
	.le-opt:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}

	.le-btn:disabled {
		opacity: 0.45;
		cursor: not-allowed;
	}

	.le-btn-primary {
		background: var(--color-accent);
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-bg);
	}

	.le-btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
		background: var(--color-accent-600);
		border-color: var(--color-accent-600);
		color: var(--color-bg);
	}

	.le-counter {
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 60%, transparent);
	}

	.le-mode[hidden] { display: none; }

	.le-slide {
		display: none;
		padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
		width: 100%;
	}

	.le-slide.is-active {
		display: block;
		animation: leFade 0.25s ease-out;
	}

	@keyframes leFade {
		from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
		to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
	}

	.le-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }

	.le-kicker {
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--color-accent-700);
	}

	.le-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight);
		font-size: 26px;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: var(--space-1) 0 var(--space-2);
	}

	.le-lead {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.5;
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 72ch;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 75%, transparent);
	}

	.le-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: var(--space-4);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.le-code {
		position: relative;
		margin: 0;
		max-height: 420px;
		overflow: auto;
		padding: var(--space-3) 0;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 12.5px;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.le-code-static {
		max-height: none;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}

	.le-line {
		display: block;
		padding: 0 var(--space-3) 0 0;
		white-space: pre;
		transition: background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.le-line.is-current {
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 18%, transparent);
		box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--color-accent);
	}

	.le-ln {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 3.5ch;
		margin-right: var(--space-2);
		text-align: right;
		color: var(--color-neutral-600);
		user-select: none;
	}

	.le-mem {
		position: relative;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: var(--space-8);
		padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-8) var(--space-4) var(--space-4);
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		min-height: 220px;
	}

	.le-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }

	.le-col > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }

	.le-col-label {
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		color: var(--color-neutral-600);
	}

	.le-arrows {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		overflow: visible;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

</style>

<style is:global>
